  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "DEPRECATION: `paket.exe` and `paket.bootstrapper.exe` are deprecated and will no longer be published from Paket 12.0 onwards. The `paket` .NET tool becomes the only supported way to run Paket: `dotnet tool install paket`. Both binaries now print a notice on every run unless `-s` is passed.\nThe bootstrapper shipped with this release never resolves a version past 11.x, so it keeps working once 12.0 ships without a `paket.exe` asset instead of failing the build. An explicitly pinned version is unaffected.",
